    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "12. Fight Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "12.07",
    "summary": "Both players consolidate with any eligible units they like, eligibility being set by the Eligible If section of the [consolidation move](vsdata:core-rule/consolidation-move). The player taking the turn finishes all of theirs first, then their opponent; there is no alternating, and no unit can consolidate more than once in this step.",
